Description: Build, read and write 'Excalidraw' scenes from R, turn 'ggplot2'
    and base graphics into editable hand-drawn drawings, and render them
    offline with the same 'rough.js' engine and handwriting fonts that
    'Excalidraw' uses. Includes the 'Excalidraw' editor as an 'htmlwidget'.
    Not affiliated with or endorsed by Excalidraw.
